  aciklama:
  - "Ayr\u0131ld\u0131\u011F\u0131n ki\u015Fi telvelerinde kendinden ne kadar da
    emin g\xF6z\xFCk\xFCyor! Burnunu yukar\u0131ya kald\u0131rm\u0131\u015F, g\xF6zlerini
    kapatm\u0131\u015F, ba\u015F\u0131 dik; sanki olacaklardan emin ve \"olmu\u015F
    olan\u0131n\" arkas\u0131nda... \U0001F928 Bir ayr\u0131l\u0131ktan sonra yeterli
    pi\u015Fmanl\u0131\u011Fa eri\u015Febilmek i\xE7in her iki taraf ad\u0131na da
    gereken tek \u015Fey zamand\u0131r {{isim}}. Giden kalan\u0131n a\u011Flad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131,
    kendisi olmadan yap\u0131lamayaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131 san\u0131r. Fakat radyo
    kapand\u0131 diye \u015Fark\u0131lar yar\u0131m kalmaz.\n\nSen de mutlu de\u011Filsin;
    fakat ona bir bedel \xF6detmeye, hatalar\u0131n\u0131 anlamas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011Flamaya
    kararl\u0131 g\xF6z\xFCk\xFCyorsun. Yaln\u0131zl\u0131\u011Fa yenik d\xFC\u015F\xFCp
    onu aramayarak do\u011Fru olan\u0131 yapt\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 s\xF6yl\xFCyor
    fincan\u0131n. Bu ki\u015Fi, g\xFCn\xFC ge\xE7irebilmek i\xE7in \u015Fu s\u0131ralar
    bir {{kelime, hobisine | arkada\u015F\u0131na}} tutunmu\u015F, onunla zaman ge\xE7iriyor.
    Ancak bilmiyor ki a\u015Fk, ge\xE7mi\u015Fi, \u015Fimdiyi ve gelece\u011Fi ayn\u0131
    anda ihata eder. Kafas\u0131n\u0131 kald\u0131rd\u0131\u011F\u0131nda senin \"olmad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131\"
    anlayarak s\u0131zlayacak {{isim}}. O vakit can havliyle yan\u0131na ko\u015Faca\u011F\u0131
    yine sen olacaks\u0131n. {{ay_2}} ay\u0131n\u0131 bekle..."
